    "lawCode": "Amd §213, St Fin L",
    "lawSection": "State Finance Law",
    "memo": " \nBILL NUMBER: S7513\n\nSPONSOR: MARTINEZ\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend the state finance law, in relation to making technical\ncorrections to a definition for purposes of the excelsior linked deposit\nprogram\n\n \nPURPOSE::\n\nThe purpose of this bill is to provide technical corrections to the\ndefinition of certified Service-Disabled Veteran Owned Business Enter-\nprises within the Excelsior Linked Deposit program.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS::\n\nSection 1. amends Subdivision 25 of section 213 of the state finance\nlaw, as added by chapter 587 of the laws of 2022 to provide technical\ncorrections to the definition of \"Certified service-disabled veteran-\nowned business enterprise\".\n\nSection 2. is the enacting clause.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION::\n\nThe Veterans' Service Law became effective on April 1, 2023, and refer-\nences to the Executive Law have been repealed. This legislation would\neffectively make technical corrections to the existing program from\nExecutive Law to Veterans' services law. The Excelsior Linked Deposit\nprogram has successfully helped businesses in New York obtain reduced\nrate financing for investments that expand the potential of these busi-\nnesses.\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS::\n\nUndetermined.\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE::\n\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n",
